libkrun runtime components
--------------------------

`crates/pvisor-vm/src/` contains consolidated, modified libkrun 1.19.3
VMM, device, architecture, HVF and supporting modules. Original manifests and
synchronization records are retained in `crates/pvisor-vm/provenance/`:

https://github.com/containers/libkrun

Copyright Red Hat, Inc. and the upstream authors and contributors. They are
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. pVisor's modifications
add the mountless copy-on-write virtio-fs backend used by pVisor and embed
the first-party Rust guest supervisor from `crates/pvisor-guest`.

libkrunfw guest firmware
-----------------------

`fw/` contains a modified copy of libkrunfw, including pVisor's guest kernel
configurations, patches and compact firmware storage generator:

https://github.com/libkrun/libkrunfw

Source identity and imported local modifications are recorded in `fw/IMPORT.md`.
The Linux kernel and kernel patches are GPL-2.0-only; the library code,
including generated library code, is LGPL-2.1-only. See
`fw/LICENSE-GPL-2.0-only` and `fw/LICENSE-LGPL-2.1-only`.
The macOS compatibility headers have separate terms in
`fw/include/macos-host/LICENSE`.

Firmware binary distributions must include the corresponding source and
license materials. These components are not covered by the repository's
first-party Apache-2.0 license.

